#ROOMDATA
#9900
Entrance to the Mansion~
A tall mansion stands before you.  Flickering
fluorescent yellow lights are visible past the cold stone
gates surrounding the perimeter. Towers rise to the east
and west, adorned by Z-Roller banners that flap
against the harsh winds.
~
5 40960 0
D0
~
~
0 0 849
D2
~
~
0 0 9901
S
#9901
The Lounge~
Sound echoes off the expansive walls as you take
your first steps into the mansion. Black leather couches are scattered
throughout and the shag carpeting bristles against your feet.
To left rise a long flight of stairs, leading to a dusty wooden door.
~
5 40960 0
D0
~
~
0 0 9900
D2
~
~
