D4
~
~
0 0 9903
S
#9902
The Fishtank~
Yellow walls encompass this fairly empty, calm room.
Bright lights shine down, reflecting off the cool waters of an aquarium.
The aroma of the kitchen slowly drifts in from a forced whole in the side wall.
~
