D3
~
~
0 0 9904
S
#9903
Observatory~
At the top of the stairs you find a dimly lit room.
A telescope points out of the eastern windows, revealing the
perverted acts of the infamous Wei Han.
~
5 40960 0
D5
~
~
0 0 9901
S
#9904
A dark passageway~
Hidden through a hole in the drywall, this small passage seems to
have been punched into the wall to function as a crude hallway.
A faint light is shining through a punched-out hole to the south.
~
